      "Container": "CharacterPanelRefined.Localization.resources",
      "Key": "Tooltips_Expected_Damage",
      "Original": "Average damage of a 100 potency skill, including critical and direct hits as well as passive traits such as Maim and Mend.\n\nA normal attack will do {@Highlight}{NormalValue}{@Clear} damage.\nA critical hit will do {@Highlight}{CritValue}{@Clear} damage.\n\nDamage always has a variance of ±5%.",
      "Translated": "100威力的技能的平均伤害，包含暴击、直击以及被动特性（如攻击与治疗）。\n\n普通攻击将造成 {@Highlight}{NormalValue}{@Clear} 伤害。\n暴击将造成 {@Highlight}{CritValue}{@Clear} 伤害。\n\n伤害始终有 ±5% 的浮动。",
